<title>USA: Granite sets special cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Granite sets special cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Construction Inc on Tuesday said its board of directors has approved a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.06 per share and a one-time special cash dividend of $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>Both will be paid April 18 to shareholders of record on March 31.</p>
<p>In addition, Granite's board of directors has authorized a 500,000 common stock repurchase program in addition to the 100,000 share buyback plan announced on March 5.</p>
<p>As of March 14, 1997, the company had 18,133,803 shares outstanding.</p>
